    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Don't tick him off!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Exploding Vengeance]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/7d2bbcefac13cd379c1c08638c718626.poster.avif?t=1753754889\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/7d2bbcefac13cd379c1c08638c718626.webm?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/7d2bbcefac13cd379c1c08638c718626.mp4?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kevin, the retired war hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Having lost everything to the alien invaders,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">he was reborn from the brink of death as a cyborg of fury!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, his explosive revenge drama begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Ultra-Fast Run &amp; Gun Action]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/e058824ff1722172b47a67cbdac24ee6.poster.avif?t=1753754889\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/e058824ff1722172b47a67cbdac24ee6.webm?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/e058824ff1722172b47a67cbdac24ee6.mp4?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relentless speed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dazzling effects covering the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powerful impact and thrilling feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience ultra-fast combat that awakens all your senses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Complete Your Style with Combat Suits]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/ad693574dbee6ee8df87f4da50358a26.poster.avif?t=1753754889\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/ad693574dbee6ee8df87f4da50358a26.webm?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/ad693574dbee6ee8df87f4da50358a26.mp4?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire various suits during combat and use them strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each suit awaits with unique looks and destructive abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete your own combat style and seize victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Perfect Harmony of Precision Controls, Puzzles &amp; Action]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/f020276cbf9dffd4da682745b168a680.poster.avif?t=1753754889\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/f020276cbf9dffd4da682745b168a680.webm?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/f020276cbf9dffd4da682745b168a680.mp4?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even amidst ultra-fast combat, split-second decisions determine fate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Precision jumps, controls testing your reflexes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and witty puzzles that don't break the flow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel the thrilling action that stimulates both hands and mind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Vast Helios System Exploration]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/867d28396596733bcdccb310e2fa0151.avif?t=1753754889\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Across 9 planets, 5 moons, and 10 chapters,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">unearth hidden collectibles and mysteries,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and fight against unpredictable, powerful bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Key Features]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 Breathtaking Ultra-Fast Action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee1 Unique &amp; Powerful Combat Suits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0c Vast Planets &amp; In-Depth Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc51 Overwhelming Epic Boss Battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a1 Exhilarating Revenge of the Hero Turned Cyborg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[A World Built Together]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your feedback shapes our future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the conversation on our Discord, X,</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Don't tick him off!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Exploding Vengeance]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/7d2bbcefac13cd379c1c08638c718626.poster.avif?t=1753754889\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/7d2bbcefac13cd379c1c08638c718626.webm?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/7d2bbcefac13cd379c1c08638c718626.mp4?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kevin, the retired war hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Having lost everything to the alien invaders,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">he was reborn from the brink of death as a cyborg of fury!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, his explosive revenge drama begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Ultra-Fast Run &amp; Gun Action]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/e058824ff1722172b47a67cbdac24ee6.poster.avif?t=1753754889\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/e058824ff1722172b47a67cbdac24ee6.webm?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/e058824ff1722172b47a67cbdac24ee6.mp4?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relentless speed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dazzling effects covering the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powerful impact and thrilling feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience ultra-fast combat that awakens all your senses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Complete Your Style with Combat Suits]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/ad693574dbee6ee8df87f4da50358a26.poster.avif?t=1753754889\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/ad693574dbee6ee8df87f4da50358a26.webm?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/ad693574dbee6ee8df87f4da50358a26.mp4?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire various suits during combat and use them strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each suit awaits with unique looks and destructive abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete your own combat style and seize victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Perfect Harmony of Precision Controls, Puzzles &amp; Action]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/f020276cbf9dffd4da682745b168a680.poster.avif?t=1753754889\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/f020276cbf9dffd4da682745b168a680.webm?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/f020276cbf9dffd4da682745b168a680.mp4?t=1753754889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even amidst ultra-fast combat, split-second decisions determine fate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Precision jumps, controls testing your reflexes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and witty puzzles that don't break the flow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel the thrilling action that stimulates both hands and mind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Vast Helios System Exploration]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/867d28396596733bcdccb310e2fa0151.avif?t=1753754889\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Across 9 planets, 5 moons, and 10 chapters,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">unearth hidden collectibles and mysteries,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and fight against unpredictable, powerful bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Key Features]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 Breathtaking Ultra-Fast Action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee1 Unique &amp; Powerful Combat Suits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0c Vast Planets &amp; In-Depth Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc51 Overwhelming Epic Boss Battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a1 Exhilarating Revenge of the Hero Turned Cyborg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[A World Built Together]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your feedback shapes our future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the conversation on our Discord, X,</p>",
    "short_description": "Don't tick him off! After losing everything he loved, Kevin returns as a raging cyborg. Unleash chaos with devastatingly diverse combat suits in this explosive, high-speed action platformer!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil, Polish",
    "reviews": "\u201cMETAL SUITS: Counter-attack is a love letter to every 2D platformer from the early PC/NES days.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Digital Chumps<br><br>\u201c...the run-up to each encounter is wonderfully hectic as you use environmental objects to blast, skewer, and otherwise slaughter adversaries.\u201d<br>77/100 \u2013 Tech-Gaming<br><br>\u201cIt ended up being one of the better side-scrolling action games I have played in a while. This is one not to miss.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 ZTGD<br>",
